      "summary": {
        "text": "Tim Heinemann (born 23 October 1997) is a German professional racing driver for Porsche. A former sim racer and two-time DTM Trophy champion, he competed in DTM in 2023, scoring a double podium on debut at Oschersleben. He has also raced in the NLS, Nürburgring 24 Hours and GT World Challenge Europe.\n\nParallel to his racing career, Heinemann works as an industrial clerk for KW Automotive.",
